Bluetooth: MGMT: Fix possible crash on mgmt_index_removed

jira KERNEL-1078
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.126.1.el8_10
commit-author Luiz Augusto von Dentz <luiz.von.dentz@intel.com>
commit f53e1c9c726d83092167f2226f32bd3b73f26c21
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.126.1.el8_10/f53e1c9c.failed

If mgmt_index_removed is called while there are commands queued on
cmd_sync it could lead to crashes like the bellow trace:

0x0000053D: __list_del_entry_valid_or_report+0x98/0xdc
0x0000053D: mgmt_pending_remove+0x18/0x58 [bluetooth]
0x0000053E: mgmt_remove_adv_monitor_complete+0x80/0x108 [bluetooth]
0x0000053E: hci_cmd_sync_work+0xbc/0x164 [bluetooth]

So while handling mgmt_index_removed this attempts to dequeue
commands passed as user_data to cmd_sync.

Fixes: 7cf5c2978f23 ("Bluetooth: hci_sync: Refactor remove Adv Monitor")
	Reported-by: jiaymao <quic_jiaymao@quicinc.com>
	Signed-off-by: Luiz Augusto von Dentz <luiz.von.dentz@intel.com>
(cherry picked from commit f53e1c9c726d83092167f2226f32bd3b73f26c21)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

# Conflicts:
#	net/bluetooth/mgmt.c
diff --cc net/bluetooth/mgmt.c
index df018eebb302,4157d9f23f46..000000000000
--- a/net/bluetooth/mgmt.c
+++ b/net/bluetooth/mgmt.c
@@@ -8896,25 -9404,16 +8901,29 @@@ void mgmt_index_removed(struct hci_dev 
  	if (test_bit(HCI_QUIRK_RAW_DEVICE, &hdev->quirks))
  		return;
  
++<<<<<<< HEAD
 +	switch (hdev->dev_type) {
 +	case HCI_PRIMARY:
 +		mgmt_pending_foreach(0, hdev, cmd_complete_rsp, &status);
++=======
+ 	mgmt_pending_foreach(0, hdev, cmd_complete_rsp, &match);
++>>>>>>> f53e1c9c726d (Bluetooth: MGMT: Fix possible crash on mgmt_index_removed)
  
 -	if (hci_dev_test_flag(hdev, HCI_UNCONFIGURED)) {
 -		mgmt_index_event(MGMT_EV_UNCONF_INDEX_REMOVED, hdev, NULL, 0,
 -				 HCI_MGMT_UNCONF_INDEX_EVENTS);
 -		ev.type = 0x01;
 -	} else {
 -		mgmt_index_event(MGMT_EV_INDEX_REMOVED, hdev, NULL, 0,
 -				 HCI_MGMT_INDEX_EVENTS);
 -		ev.type = 0x00;
 +		if (hci_dev_test_flag(hdev, HCI_UNCONFIGURED)) {
 +			mgmt_index_event(MGMT_EV_UNCONF_INDEX_REMOVED, hdev,
 +					 NULL, 0, HCI_MGMT_UNCONF_INDEX_EVENTS);
 +			ev.type = 0x01;
 +		} else {
 +			mgmt_index_event(MGMT_EV_INDEX_REMOVED, hdev, NULL, 0,
 +					 HCI_MGMT_INDEX_EVENTS);
 +			ev.type = 0x00;
 +		}
 +		break;
 +	case HCI_AMP:
 +		ev.type = 0x02;
 +		break;
 +	default:
 +		return;
  	}
  
  	ev.bus = hdev->bus;
* Unmerged path net/bluetooth/mgmt.c
